    "created_at": "2016-10-17T12:25:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-17T12:25:52Z",
    "body": "The `form.reset()` case seems similar in principle to `video.volume=0.5` queueing a task to fire a trusted volumechange event. `form.reset()` does dispatch the trusted reset event synchronously, but I don't think that matters.\n\nIf all UA-created events _except_ the ones created inside `click()` have `isTrusted` set to true, that's at least a kind of simple.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
