    "created_at": "2016-10-19T20:22:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-19T20:22:26Z",
    "body": "Perhaps I don't follow the spec change. But it seems isTrusted is true most of the time which is entirely incorrect...\n\nHere is an example where it is false:\nhttp://jsbin.com/lewegog/edit?html,output\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
